- I did not check whether any router implementation (`src/router/*`) does anything error-related before `compose` is invoked (unlikely, but unread).
- I did not check `compose.test.ts` for documented edge-case assertions (e.g. behavior when `onError` itself throws).
- I did not verify `ErrorHandler`'s exact type signature in `src/types.ts` (only inferred usage from call sites).

